      "start": 266.08,
      "end": 269.36,
      "text": "Then what are you waiting for? Now fill the form by clicking on the link"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        127
      ],
      "start": 268.0,
      "end": 271.12,
      "text": "given in the description and comment box below."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        128
      ],
      "start": 271.12,
      "end": 274.479,
      "text": "After that our team will connect with you and"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        129
      ],
      "start": 272.8,
      "end": 276.56,
      "text": "provide you detailed information about it."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        130
      ],
      "start": 274.479,
      "end": 278.32,
      "text": "So see you in the community. Let us now"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        131
      ],
      "start": 276.56,
      "end": 279.919,
      "text": "move towards the video. Some time ago,"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        132
      ],
      "start": 278.32,
      "end": 281.759,
      "text": "Donald Trump was"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        133
      ],
      "start": 279.919,
      "end": 284.16,
      "text": "accused of manipulating the crude oil market. Look,"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        134
      ],
      "start": 284.16,
      "end": 288.24,
      "text": "this post of Trump came on March 23 at around 7:00 am US time. It is"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        135
      ],
      "start": 286.08,
      "end": 290.32,
      "text": "written in this post that in the last two"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        136
      ],
      "start": 288.24,
      "end": 292.639,
      "text": "days, talks are going on between Iran and USA on"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        137
      ],
      "start": 290.32,
      "end": 294.88,
      "text": "how to stop the war."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        138
      ],
      "start": 292.639,
      "end": 296.88,
      "text": "Due to which the US will not attack Iran's power plants for the next 5 days. That"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        139
      ],
      "start": 294.88,
      "end": 298.56,
      "text": "means the world"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        140
      ],
      "start": 296.88,
      "end": 300.639,
      "text": "felt that there would be a ceasefire here"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        141
      ],
      "start": 298.56,
      "end": 302.16,
      "text": "and then there would be no attack etc."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        142
      ],
      "start": 300.639,
      "end": 303.919,
      "text": "But then later the world came to know that"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        143
      ],
      "start": 302.16,
      "end": 305.84,
      "text": "this post was nothing but a big"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        144
      ],
      "start": 303.919,
      "end": 307.44,
      "text": "lie. In fact, Iran responded by saying"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        145
      ],
      "start": 305.84,
      "end": 309.12,
      "text": "that we have not had any conversation with Donald Trump."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        146
      ],
      "start": 307.44,
      "end": 311.44,
      "text": "In fact, the US is"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        147
      ],
      "start": 309.12,
      "end": 313.44,
      "text": "negotiating with itself. Now what happened after this was that"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        148
      ],
      "start": 311.44,
      "end": 315.919,
      "text": "after Donald Trump's post, the"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        149
      ],
      "start": 313.44,
      "end": 318.32,
      "text": "crude oil prices which had immediately fallen by 15%"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        150
      ],
      "start": 315.919,
      "end": 320.639,
      "text": "to $85, started rising again"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        151
      ],
      "start": 318.32,
      "end": 322.16,
      "text": "and went to $92. In such a situation, the whole world"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        152
      ],
      "start": 320.639,
      "end": 324.32,
      "text": "was in confusion mode as to what was happening"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        153
      ],
      "start": 322.16,
      "end": 326.08,
      "text": "? After all, with whom is Donald Trump negotiating"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        154
      ],
      "start": 324.32,
      "end": 328.479,
      "text": "? But later the truth comes out"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        155
      ],
      "start": 326.08,
      "end": 330.479,
      "text": "that it was all a drama and nothing else. In"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        156
      ],
      "start": 328.479,
      "end": 332.32,
      "text": "fact, Trump made this post so that"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        157
      ],
      "start": 330.479,
      "end": 334.32,
      "text": "he could manipulate the market, especially crude oil,"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        158
      ],
      "start": 332.32,
      "end": 337.28,
      "text": "and there is ample evidence for this."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        159
      ],
      "start": 334.32,
      "end": 339.199,
      "text": "Look, Donald Trump posted this at 7:05 am"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        160
      ],
      "start": 337.28,
      "end": 341.28,
      "text": "and interestingly,"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        161
      ],
      "start": 339.199,
      "end": 343.919,
      "text": "just 15 minutes"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        162
      ],
      "start": 341.28,
      "end": 345.52,
      "text": "before that, on 649, there was"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        163
      ],
      "start": 343.919,
      "end": 348.479,
      "text": "a huge spike in the trading volume of crude oil futures in the crude oil futures market."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        164
      ],
      "start": 345.52,
      "end": 350.16,
      "text": "About 6200 Brent and"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        165
      ],
      "start": 348.479,
      "end": 351.84,
      "text": "West Texas Intermediate futures"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        166
      ],
      "start": 350.16,
      "end": 354.96,
      "text": "contracts are traded during this period. Whose"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        167
      ],
      "start": 351.84,
      "end": 356.72,
      "text": "notional value is around ₹55 crores. Now"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        168
      ],
      "start": 354.96,
      "end": 358.96,
      "text": "you will say that this must be happening normally."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        169
      ],
      "start": 356.72,
      "end": 360.639,
      "text": "No. Here the data says that if we"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        170
      ],
      "start": 360.639,
      "end": 365.28,
      "text": "look at the average volume of the last five days, it was only an average of 700 contracts."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        171
      ],
      "start": 362.8,
      "end": 367.759,
      "text": "Now here,"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        172
      ],
      "start": 365.28,
      "end": 369.6,
      "text": "before Trump's post, a jump from 700 to 6200 was"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        173
      ],
      "start": 367.759,
      "end": 371.919,
      "text": "seen, which was"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        174
      ],
      "start": 369.6,
      "end": 373.84,
      "text": "almost nine times more than the average volume. The only meaning that"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        175
      ],
      "start": 371.919,
      "end": 375.44,
      "text": "can be derived from this is that some people knew"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        176
      ],
      "start": 373.84,
      "end": 377.039,
      "text": "about this upcoming post of Donald Trump."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        177
      ],
      "start": 375.44,
      "end": 378.8,
      "text": "Due to which he"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        178
      ],
      "start": 377.039,
      "end": 381.039,
      "text": "took a position before the post and as soon as the crude oil"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        179
      ],
      "start": 378.8,
      "end": 383.12,
      "text": "prices fell by 15%,"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        180
      ],
      "start": 381.039,
      "end": 385.12,
      "text": "he made a good amount of millions of dollars and"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        181
      ],
      "start": 383.12,
      "end": 386.88,
      "text": "exited the market. Now you will say that if"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        182
      ],
      "start": 385.12,
      "end": 388.72,
      "text": "manipulation is happening openly then what is the"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        183
      ],
      "start": 386.88,
      "end": 390.08,
      "text": "regulator or regulatory board"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        184
      ],
      "start": 388.72,
      "end": 392.0,
      "text": "doing there? So see, in USA it"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        185
      ],
      "start": 392.0,
      "end": 396.16,
      "text": "comes under the Commodity Futures Trading Commission i.e. CFTC. If there is any irregularity, it"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        186
      ],
      "start": 396.16,
      "end": 399.039,
      "text": "is the job of the CFTC to take action on it. Now the question arises that"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        187
      ],
      "start": 397.44,
      "end": 400.8,
      "text": "when clear manipulation is visible to the common people then"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        188
      ],
      "start": 399.039,
      "end": 402.56,
      "text": "why is CFTC not taking action? Now"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        189
      ],
      "start": 400.8,
      "end": 404.319,
      "text": "see, Trump is the king of manipulation,"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        190
      ],
      "start": 402.56,
      "end": 406.479,
      "text": "so what he did is interesting."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        191
      ],
      "start": 404.319,
      "end": 409.12,
      "text": "What he did was, last December,"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        192
      ],
      "start": 409.12,
      "end": 413.28,
      "text": "he appointed one of his key individuals, Michael S. Sellick, as head of the CFTC. This"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        193
      ],
      "start": 411.199,
      "end": 415.12,
      "text": "means that now CFTC will"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        194
      ],
      "start": 413.28,
      "end": 416.56,
      "text": "not take any action against Trump because Trump's"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        195
      ],
      "start": 415.12,
      "end": 418.479,
      "text": "own man is sitting there. Now we have"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        196
      ],
      "start": 416.56,
      "end": 420.08,
      "text": "talked about crude oil but the matter does not end here."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        197
      ],
      "start": 418.479,
      "end": 421.84,
      "text": "Trump's family member"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        198
      ],
      "start": 420.08,
      "end": 423.68,
      "text": "also has connection with a prediction app"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        199
      ],
      "start": 421.84,
      "end": 425.599,
      "text": "named Poly Market which is a gambling app."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        200
      ],
      "start": 423.68,
      "end": 427.199,
      "text": "Nowadays, its ads have started appearing in"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        201
      ],
      "start": 425.599,
      "end": 429.039,
      "text": "which people earn money by predicting the future"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        202
      ],
      "start": 427.199,
      "end": 431.039,
      "text": "and Trump Jr.'s"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        203
      ],
      "start": 429.039,
      "end": 432.88,
      "text": "venture capital firm is also an investor in this app."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        204
      ],
      "start": 431.039,
      "end": 434.639,
      "text": "In the past it has been seen that there are some accounts on Poly Market."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        205
      ],
      "start": 432.88,
      "end": 436.639,
      "text": "He makes very accurate"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        206
      ],
      "start": 434.639,
      "end": 438.4,
      "text": "predictions. Now when USA"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        207
      ],
      "start": 436.639,
      "end": 440.24,
      "text": "attacked Iran, the whole world was shocked as to"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        208
      ],
      "start": 438.4,
      "end": 442.0,
      "text": "why did US do this? But there were"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        209
      ],
      "start": 440.24,
      "end": 443.68,
      "text": "six accounts on Poly Market that"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        210
      ],
      "start": 442.0,
      "end": 446.639,
      "text": "earned Rs 100 crore by predicting that the"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        211
      ],
      "start": 443.68,
      "end": 448.319,
      "text": "US was going to attack Iran in the next 48 hours."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        212
      ],
      "start": 446.639,
      "end": 449.84,
      "text": "Now after this, questions started being raised on Poly Market not only in the US"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        213
      ],
      "start": 448.319,
      "end": 451.919,
      "text": "but all over the world"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        214
      ],
      "start": 449.84,
      "end": 453.84,
      "text": "and people also started feeling"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        215
      ],
      "start": 451.919,
      "end": 455.52,
      "text": "that there are some people on this platform"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        216
      ],
      "start": 453.84,
      "end": 457.36,
      "text": "whom Trump messages before taking any action."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        217
      ],
      "start": 455.52,
      "end": 458.88,
      "text": "Now it is very difficult to find out the details of these six people who are making"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        218
      ],
      "start": 457.36,
      "end": 460.24,
      "text": "constant predictions"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        219
      ],
      "start": 458.88,
      "end": 461.599,
      "text": "and"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        220
      ],
      "start": 460.24,
      "end": 463.28,
      "text": "mainly transactions on this platform happen"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        221
      ],
      "start": 461.599,
      "end": 465.44,
      "text": "through crypto. So tracking"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        222
      ],
      "start": 463.28,
      "end": 467.28,
      "text": "is very tough. An account holder on this platform had"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        223
      ],
      "start": 465.44,
      "end": 469.36,
      "text": "correctly predicted"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        224
      ],
      "start": 467.28,
      "end": 471.44,
      "text": "that Venezuelan President Maduro would be"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        225
      ],
      "start": 469.36,
      "end": 473.44,
      "text": "captured by the US. After which he"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        226
      ],
      "start": 471.44,
      "end": 475.68,
      "text": "won approximately ₹400 crores. So if we look at it,"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        227
      ],
      "start": 473.44,
      "end": 478.4,
      "text": "Poly Market"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        228
      ],
      "start": 475.68,
      "end": 480.479,
      "text": "is 90% accurate in predicting global events and this thing is quite"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        229
      ],
      "start": 478.4,
      "end": 482.08,
      "text": "unusual. If we talk about the stock market,"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        230
      ],
      "start": 480.479,
      "end": 483.68,
      "text": "Donald Trump has been accused dozens of times"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        231
      ],
      "start": 482.08,
      "end": 485.52,
      "text": "that he"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        232
      ],
      "start": 483.68,
      "end": 487.52,
      "text": "manipulates the stock market. Be it the"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        233
      ],
      "start": 485.52,
      "end": 489.44,
      "text": "time of tariffs or the"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        234
      ],
      "start": 487.52,
      "end": 491.36,
      "text": "time of Russia-Ukraine war. The sad reality is"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        235
      ],
      "start": 489.44,
      "end": 493.44,
      "text": "that the President of the world's most powerful country is"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        236
      ],
      "start": 491.36,
      "end": 495.12,
      "text": "doing such things today and this is"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        237
      ],
      "start": 493.44,
      "end": 496.96,
      "text": "happening in a country where the"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        238
      ],
      "start": 495.12,
      "end": 498.879,
      "text": "law is very strict for the common citizen. If you pick up something from the mall, you get"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        239
      ],
      "start": 496.96,
      "end": 500.4,
      "text": "jailed for a year"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        240
      ],
      "start": 498.879,
      "end": 502.08,
      "text": "and here the President himself is"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        241
      ],
      "start": 500.4,
      "end": 503.919,
      "text": "manipulating the market. Personally, I would"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        242
      ],
      "start": 502.08,
      "end": 505.919,
      "text": "n't be shocked if Donald Trump ends up in"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        243
      ],
      "start": 505.919,
      "end": 509.599,
      "text": "jail instead of home after his presidency. Now let me"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        244
      ],
      "start": 507.919,
      "end": 511.919,
      "text": "remind you of a sad news that it has been"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        245
      ],
      "start": 509.599,
      "end": 514.0,
      "text": "only 14 to 15 months since Trump came to power. There are"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        246
      ],
      "start": 511.919,
      "end": 515.599,
      "text": "still 2 years and 9 months left. The"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        247
      ],
      "start": 514.0,
      "end": 517.519,
      "text": "market has definitely grown today. But the"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        248
      ],
      "start": 515.599,
      "end": 519.36,
      "text": "Indian market is where it was in the last 14 months."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        249
      ],
      "start": 517.519,
      "end": 521.12,
      "text": "So imagine what will happen in the next 2 years and 10 months"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        250
      ],
      "start": 519.36,
      "end": 522.88,
      "text": "? Just thinking about it makes me nervous."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        251
      ],
      "start": 521.12,
      "end": 524.88,
      "text": "Now the ceasefire here is for two"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        252
      ],
      "start": 522.88,
      "end": 526.88,
      "text": "weeks. Now what happens next will"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        253
      ],
      "start": 524.88,
      "end": 528.64,
      "text": "start the excitement again from there. If this"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        254
      ],
      "start": 526.88,
      "end": 530.959,
      "text": "war continues again and the problem arises, then there will"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_ids": [
        255
      ],
      "start": 530.959,
      "end": 535.279,
